        },
        {
          "word": " too.",
          "start": 616.18,
          "end": 616.18,
          "speaker": "Behrouz"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, of course.",
      "start": 616.18,
      "end": 618.28,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Yes,",
          "start": 616.18,
          "end": 616.18,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " of",
          "start": 616.18,
          "end": 616.18,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " course.",
          "start": 616.18,
          "end": 618.28,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She was a believer, as stated in the Quran. The other lesson is...",
